4/SHA256SUMS"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/owo10086/sni-panel/releases/assets/638963154","id":638963154,"node_id":"RA_kwDOUXf21c4mFc3S","name":"THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"text/markdown; charset=utf-8","state":"uploaded","size":1472,"digest":"sha256:d3572e3ddda1ee140458bcceee17babef7876a859738cd7892b50f97ca21fe72","download_count":0,"created_at":"2026-10-14T02:30:54Z","updated_at":"2026-10-14T02:30:54Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/owo10086/sni-panel/releases/download/v3.3.4/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/owo10086/sni-panel/tarball/v3.3.4","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/owo10086/sni-panel/zipball/v3.3.4","body":"## 简体中文\n\n### 修复\n\n- 修复 SNI 分流规则批量编辑和切换入口时，把合法共用 443 的不同域名误判为端口占用的问题。主机型转发组、端口转发、转发链和直接 TLS 隧道共用保存顺序，不同资源使用同一台主机时也受到保护。\n- 等待完成后重新读取入口路线和共享规则；入口变化时释放旧位置，按最新路线重新处理，持续变化时明确提示刷新重试。保留重复域名、普通规则端口冲突、权限及资源限制检查，业务端口保持用户指定值。\n- 修复规则迁回旧入口时，被先前延后清理错误停用的问题。直接 TLS 隧道创建或编辑保存失败时，规则、端口对应关系和必要隧道状态一起撤回，避免报错后留下部分修改。\n- DNS 更新前释放保存保护，慢更新不会拦住同组其他规则保存。费用继续在数据库提交后结算，沿用逐项编辑结果、未选中规则保留及原有运行确认标准。\n\n### 版本与升级说明\n\n- 面板：`3.3.4`；Agent 和 ForwardX FXP runtime：`3.3.0`。本版只需升级面板，现有 Agent／FXP 继续兼容。\n- 升级不会自动补做此前失败的批量编辑。请按逐项结果核对规则当前归属、域名、端口和目标，再重试尚未完成的项目；保存成功仍需等待入口、出口按原有标准确认运行。\n- 原生 Android、iOS／iPadOS 应用继续按长期约定排除，本版不发布 APK／IPA。\n\n---\n\n## English\n\n### Fixes\n\n- Fix valid SNI rules with different hostnames being reported as port conflicts when editing them in batches or moving them between entries while sharing port 443. Host-based forwarding groups, port forwarding, forwarding chains and direct TLS tunnels share the same save ordering, including different resources using the same host.\n- Reread entry routes and shared rules after waiting. Release old saving positions and retry against the latest route when entries change; report persistent changes with a refresh-and-retry message. Preserve duplicate-hostname, ordinary-rule port conflict, permission and resource checks, and retain the requested business port.\n- Fix deferred cleanup disabling reused members when a rule returns to a previous entry. Roll back the rule, port mappings and required tunnel state together if a direct TLS tunnel rule cannot be created or updated, avoiding partial changes after an error.\n- Release saving protection before DNS updates so a slow provider does not block other rules in the same group. Keep traffic settlement after the database commit, existing per-item editing results, unselected rules and runtime confirmation standards.\n\n### Versions and upgrade notes\n\n- Panel: `3.3.4`; Agent and ForwardX FXP runtime: `3.3.0`. Only the panel requires upgrading; existing Agent/FXP binaries remain compatible.\n- Upgrading does not automatically retry previously failed batch edits. Check each rule's current resource, hostname, port and destination against the per-item results before retrying unfinished items. A successful save still requires the existing entry/exit runtime confirmations.\n- Native Android and iOS/iPadOS applications remain excluded under the standing agreement. This release does not publish APK or IPA packages.\n"}